The providers table stores information about providers, including their name, email, phone number, and schedule.

| Column Name | Data Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| id | SERIAL | Unique identifier for the provider |
| name | VARCHAR(255) | Provider name |
| email | VARCHAR(255) | Provider email |
| phone_number | VARCHAR(20) | Provider phone number |
| schedule | JSONB | Provider schedule |